        <UserObject label="&lt;div&gt;Microsoft Fabric:﻿&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Microsoft Fabric is a unified analytics platform — one product that covers the entire data journey from raw data to business&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;insights&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Before Fabric — you needed many separate services:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;Azure Data Factory&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; (pipelines)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;Azure Databricks&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; (Spark)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;Azure Synapse&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;(warehouse)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;Azure ML&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; (machine learning)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;Power BI&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; (reports)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;ADLS Gen2&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;(storage)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;→ You bought, connected, secured, and managed all of these separately&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;With Fabric — it&#39;s all one thing:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;One platform&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;One license&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;One lake (OneLake)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;One security model&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;One governance layer&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;→ Everything talks to everything natively&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" tags="Background" id="57">
          <mxCell parent="v6KJWzv49UGwaOHNlOtg-516" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;vsdxID=1043;fillColor=none;gradientColor=none;shape=stencil(nZBLDoAgDERP0z3SIyjew0SURgSD+Lu9kMZoXLhwN9O+tukAlrNpJg1SzDH4QW/URgNYgZTkjA4UkwJUgGXng+6DX1zLfmoymdXo17xh5zmRJ6Q42BWCfc2oJfdAr+Yv+AP9Cb7OJ3H/2JG1HNGz/84klThPVCc=);strokeColor=none;points=[];labelBackgroundColor=none;rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontStyle=1;fontSize=30;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;" vertex="1">
